        "# 2. Compound Interest Calculator\n",
        "\n",
        "Let's begin with a simple investment.\n",
        "\n",
        "Suppose you invest:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Initial investment = **$10,000**\n",
        "- Annual interest rate = **7%**\n",
        "- Time = **30 years**\n",
        "\n",
        "We will compare different compounding frequencies.\n",
        "Let's begin with a simple investment.\n",
        "\n",
        "Suppose you invest:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Initial investment = **$10,000**\n",
        "- Annual interest rate = **7%**\n",
        "- Time = **30 years**\n",
        "\n",
        "We will compare different compounding frequencies."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "RzUWFI3CE5Ho"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Compound Interest Function\n",
        "\n",
        "def compound_interest(P, r, n, t):\n",
        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "    Calculate the future value of an investment\n",
        "    using compound interest.\n",
        "\n",
        "    P = principal\n",
        "    r = annual interest rate (decimal)\n",
        "    n = number of compounding periods per year\n",
        "    t = number of years\n",
        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    return P * (1 + r/n)**(n*t)\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# Example investment\n",
        "P = 10000\n",
        "r = 0.07\n",
        "t = 18\n",
        "\n",
        "# Different compounding frequencies\n",
        "frequencies = {\n",
        "    \"Annually\": 1,\n",
        "    \"Quarterly\": 4,\n",
        "    \"Monthly\": 12,\n",
        "    \"Daily\": 365\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Initial Investment:\", f\"${P:,.2f}\")\n",
        "print(\"Annual Interest Rate:\", f\"{r*100:.2f}%\")\n",
        "print(\"Investment Period:\", t, \"years\")\n",
        "print()\n",
        "\n",
        "for name, n in frequencies.items():\n",
        "    A = compound_interest(P, r, n, t)\n",
        "    print(f\"{name:12}: ${A:,.2f}\")"
      ],
