        "# 3. Comparing Compounding Frequencies\n",
        "\n",
        "Does it make a big difference whether interest is compounded annually, quarterly, monthly, or daily?\n",
        "\n",
        "Let's visualize the differences.\n",
        "\n",
        "We will use Plotly so that you can:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Hover over the graph.\n",
        "- Zoom in and out.\n",
        "- Compare different investment strategies.\n",
        "- Examine the growth over time."
