        "# 9. The Power of Starting Early\n",
        "\n",
        "Consider two investors.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Investor A\n",
        "\n",
        "Starts investing at age **25**.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Investor B\n",
        "\n",
        "Starts investing at age **35**.\n",
        "\n",
        "Suppose both investors:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Start with \\$10,000\n",
        "- Contribute $500 per month\n",
        "- Earn an average annual return of 7%\n",
        "\n",
        "Investor A invests for 40 years.\n",
        "\n",
        "Investor B invests for 30 years.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Question\n",
        "\n",
        "How much does the extra 10 years of investing matter?\n",
        "\n",
        "This demonstrates one of the most important ideas in personal finance:\n",
        "\n",
        "> **Time can be more powerful than trying to perfectly time the market.**"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "btFPLpSEHapz"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Compare starting early vs. starting later\n",
        "\n",
        "investor_A = investment_with_monthly_contributions(\n",
        "    initial_investment=10000,\n",
        "    monthly_contribution=500,\n",
        "    annual_rate=0.07,\n",
        "    years=40\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "investor_B = investment_with_monthly_contributions(\n",
        "    initial_investment=10000,\n",
        "    monthly_contribution=500,\n",
        "    annual_rate=0.07,\n",
        "    years=30\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# Adjust Investor B's timeline so both can be compared\n",
        "investor_B[\"Calendar Year\"] = investor_B[\"Year\"] + 10\n",
        "investor_A[\"Calendar Year\"] = investor_A[\"Year\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# Create graph\n",
        "\n",
        "fig = go.Figure()\n",
        "\n",
        "fig.add_trace(\n",
        "    go.Scatter(\n",
        "        x=investor_A[\"Calendar Year\"],\n",
        "        y=investor_A[\"Balance\"],\n",
        "        mode=\"lines\",\n",
        "        name=\"Investor A: Starts at 25\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "fig.add_trace(\n",
        "    go.Scatter(\n",
        "        x=investor_B[\"Calendar Year\"],\n",
        "        y=investor_B[\"Balance\"],\n",
        "        mode=\"lines\",\n",
        "        name=\"Investor B: Starts at 35\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "fig.update_layout(\n",
        "    title=\"The Power of Starting Early\",\n",
        "    xaxis_title=\"Years Since Investor A Started\",\n",
        "    yaxis_title=\"Investment Value ($)\",\n",
        "    hovermode=\"x unified\",\n",
        "    template=\"plotly_white\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "fig.show()\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# Final values\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\n",
        "    \"Investor A final value:\",\n",
        "    f\"${investor_A.iloc[-1]['Balance']:,.2f}\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\n",
        "    \"Investor B final value:\",\n",
        "    f\"${investor_B.iloc[-1]['Balance']:,.2f}\"\n",
        ")"
      ],
